OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council and Unison
OL,4,Areach agreement in pay and grading row
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council and the largest
OL,7,Fcouncil union, Unison, have reached an
OL,8,Fagreement in a pay and grading dispute.
OL,10,FThe local authority says this means it
OL,11,Fwill not consider firing and rehiring
OL,12,Fmore than 23,000 staff.
OL,14,FThe dispute was over the new pay and
OL,15,Fgrading structure designed to deal with
OL,16,Fthe underlying issues which led to
OL,17,Fthousands of equal pay claims from
OL,18,Ffemale workers past and present.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
