OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council and Unison
OL,4,Areach agreement in pay and grading row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original proposal would have
OL,7,Fresulted in wage cuts for 11% of the
OL,8,Femployees assessed so far but, under
OL,9,Fthe new deal, their salaries will now
OL,10,Fbe protected for three years.
